# IncomingPacketActions / seam singletons (#137 / #142)

## IncomingPacketActions

- **Deleted** under [#142](https://github.com/FioraSolutions/Fineage/issues/142). Do not restore `IncomingPacketActions.cs`.
- Use `*PacketServices` / VContainer `[Inject]` instead.
- CI guard: `scripts/check-frozen-incoming-packet-actions.py` asserts the file stays gone.

## Seam singletons (start set)

Do **not** introduce new `*.Instance` call sites for:

- `World.Instance`
- `GameManager.Instance`
- `EventProcessor.Instance`
- `PlayerController.Instance`

These getters are `[Obsolete("Use [Inject] instead")]`. New code should use VContainer `[Inject]` instead of the static locator.
